{"id":"c519265e139e2e2f","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-choquet-space.md","title":"Choquet Space","display":"df-choquet-space — Choquet Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-choquet-space","aliases":["58-df-choquet-space"],"display":"df-choquet-space — Choquet Space","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-choquet-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-choquet-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-choquet-space — Choquet Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\sigma,p,h\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\sigma,p,h\\in V\\)</span> (参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span> (拓扑谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Choquet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Choquet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (本文件定义的 Choquet 空间谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choquet\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Choquet}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land X\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal H,\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathcal H=\\{h\\mid\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(h,2n+1,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in2n+1\\;(j=i+1\\to h(j)\\subseteq h(i)))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\mathcal H,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall h\\in\\mathcal H\\;(\\sigma(h)\\subseteq h(\\operatorname{dom}(h)-1))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\omega,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n+1)\\subseteq p(n))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(2n+1)=\\sigma(p\\upharpoonright(2n+1)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{41mm}\\to\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\ne\\varnothing\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choquet\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Choquet}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land X\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal H,\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathcal H=\\{h\\mid\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(h,2n+1,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in2n+1\\;(j=i+1\\to h(j)\\subseteq h(i)))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\mathcal H,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall h\\in\\mathcal H\\;(\\sigma(h)\\subseteq h(\\operatorname{dom}(h)-1))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\omega,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n+1)\\subseteq p(n))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(2n+1)=\\sigma(p\\upharpoonright(2n+1)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{41mm}\\to\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\ne\\varnothing\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本约定下空集方走偶数步，非空集方走奇数步；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的定义域是所有以空集方一步结束的有限合法历史。</li>\n<li>获胜条件显式要求每个遵循 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的无限嵌套开集对局具有非空交；仅“存在任意策略”不足以定义 Choquet 性。</li>\n<li>每个完全可度量空间都是 Choquet；原文件中“所有可度量空间都是 Choquet”过强。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$ (拓扑谓词, see [[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (函数谓词, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\sigma,p,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Choquet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choquet\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Choquet}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land X\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal H,\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathcal H=\\{h\\mid\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(h,2n+1,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in2n+1\\;(j=i+1\\to h(j)\\subseteq h(i)))\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,\\mathcal H,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall h\\in\\mathcal H\\;(\\sigma(h)\\subseteq h(\\operatorname{dom}(h)-1))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\omega,\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(n+1)\\subseteq p(n))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p(2n+1)=\\sigma(p\\upharpoonright(2n+1)))\\\\\n&\\hspace{41mm}\\to\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\ne\\varnothing\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1842,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-choquet-space]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-choquet-space.md|58-df-choquet-space]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["e7514bc4cefba4f2","36d7463d215be751"]}